1
00:00:00,122 --> 00:00:02,202
(Leonard:)Still can't believe
she's going out with me.

2
00:00:02,374 --> 00:00:03,914
(Raj:)Nobody can.

3
00:00:05,460 --> 00:00:07,880
(Howard:)That reminds me,
I have a bone to pick with you.

4
00:00:08,046 --> 00:00:10,086
(Leonard:)-What?
-You and I made a pact...

5
00:00:10,257 --> 00:00:12,757
(Howard:)...that if either of us
ever got a hot girlfriend...

6
00:00:12,926 --> 00:00:14,966
(Howard:)...that person
would have his girlfriend...

7
00:00:15,137 --> 00:00:17,677
(Howard:)...hook the other guy up
with one of her girlfriends.

8
00:00:17,889 --> 00:00:19,769
(Leonard:)-Yeah, I don't remember that.
-Wha--?

9
00:00:19,933 --> 00:00:22,143
(Sheldon:)June 30th, 2004.

10
00:00:22,727 --> 00:00:25,477
(Sheldon:)Opening day of Spider-Man 2
at the AMC Pasadena.

11
00:00:25,647 --> 00:00:29,357
(Sheldon:)They only had red ICEES, no blue.

12
00:00:29,568 --> 00:00:30,608
(Leonard:)Oh, yeah.

13
00:00:30,777 --> 00:00:33,487
Yeah, you've been with Penny
for like a month and a half.

14
00:00:33,655 --> 00:00:35,865
(Howard:)Where's my shorty, Morty?

15
00:00:36,032 --> 00:00:38,492
(Leonard:)Howard, you can't hold me to that.

16
00:00:38,660 --> 00:00:40,540
(Howard:)-Why not?
-When I made that agreement...

17
00:00:40,704 --> 00:00:45,004
...I didn't think I'd ever have a girlfriend,
and I was positive you never would.

18
00:00:45,667 --> 00:00:49,337
(Raj:)-How come I wasn't part of this deal?
-You had left the refreshment stand...

19
00:00:49,504 --> 00:00:53,924
(Sheldon:)...in order to indulge in your customary
preemptive pre-show urination.

20
00:00:54,342 --> 00:00:58,892
(Raj:)So that's how it works? I have a teeny
bladder and I don't get a hot girlfriend?

21
00:00:59,055 --> 00:01:02,015
(Howard:)Yeah, Raj, that's how it works.

22
00:01:02,601 --> 00:01:05,021
(Raj:)Damn.

